Z||000002||ChopTop||08-21-2001||02:06 PM||||Well of course I vote for Lansing, its' centrally located and the capital of the state <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Potter Park Zoo would be a good place.  You have to pay to park, but if you also want to go into the zoo that's a separate charge.  We also have Francis Park, free parking.  Nice park in a nice area of town, rose garden/picnic tables/grills/covered pavillion/children play areas/large green spaces/large cement patio that overlooks the Grand River.  FP would be my first choice.  Any time other than Labor Day would work for me.||||reg||14
