Z||000031||ChopTop||08-23-2001||09:49 AM||||Francis Park is located on Moores River Drive. There are two entrances, both on Moores River Drive, approximately 1/8 mile apart from each other.  I suggest meeting close to the pavillion at 2pm.  Since I'm the closest I'll try and get there early, and will be driving my "work in progress" choptop Fiero.  Also, no pets are allowed.  Alcohol I'm not sure about, but if you bring any I'd suggest using creative coverage methods. I'm going to assume this is a rain or shine get together, since the current forecast calls for rain showers on Saturday.  See you folks there.||||reg||8
